<!-- ── Quick Start ── -->
<section class="sec" id="quickstart">
  <div class="sec-title">⚡ Quick Start</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">핵심 패턴: <code>create_taskresult()</code> + <code>PerformanceMonitor</code>. 점수 필드는 자동으로 계산됩니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">기본 사용 패턴</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
<pre><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> PerformanceMonitor, create_taskresult

monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>(output_dir=<span class="st">"results/"</span>)

task = <span class="fn">create_taskresult</span>(
    task_id=<span class="st">"task_001"</span>,
    question=<span class="st">"한국의 수도는?"</span>,
    response=<span class="st">"서울입니다."</span>,
    ground_truth=<span class="st">"서울"</span>,
    execution_time=<span class="nm">1.23</span>,
)
monitor.<span class="fn">record_task</span>(task)
monitor.<span class="fn">save_to_file</span>(<span class="st">"eval_run"</span>)  <span class="cm"># → results/eval_run.json + .html</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">컨텍스트 매니저 패턴</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
<pre><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> evaluation_session, create_taskresult

<span class="kw">with</span> <span class="fn">evaluation_session</span>(<span class="st">"session_01"</span>, output_dir=<span class="st">"results/"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> monitor:
    <span class="kw">for</span> q, expected <span class="kw">in</span> test_cases:
        task = <span class="fn">create_taskresult</span>(task_id=<span class="st">f"t_{i}"</span>, question=q, response=agent.<span class="fn">run</span>(q), ground_truth=expected, execution_time=<span class="nm">1.0</span>)
        monitor.<span class="fn">record_task</span>(task)
<span class="cm"># 세션 종료 시 자동 저장</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">대시보드 실행</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
<pre><span class="cm"># pip install "agent-evaluator[serve]" 필요</span>
agent-eval serve                        <span class="cm"># 기본: ./results, 포트 8765</span>
agent-eval serve ./results --port <span class="nm">8080</span> --watch</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── 설치 ── -->
<section class="sec" id="install">
  <div class="sec-title">📦 설치 &amp; 의존성</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">Python 3.8+. Core 의존성: <code>numpy</code>, <code>pandas</code>, <code>python-dotenv</code>. 필요한 extras만 선택 설치.</div>

  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin:0 0 6px">단위 extras — 필요한 것만 선택</div>
  <table class="mtable" style="margin-bottom:16px">
    <thead><tr><th>Extra</th><th>설치 명령</th><th>추가 기능</th><th>주요 의존성</th><th>설치 속도</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">core</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install agent-evaluator</code></td>
        <td>Layer 1+2 (16종 지표), CLI (<code>agent-eval</code>)</td>
        <td>numpy ≥1.20, pandas ≥1.3, python-dotenv ≥0.19</td>
        <td>⚡ 빠름</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">llm</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[llm]"</code></td>
        <td>LLMHelper (OpenAI), ClaudeHelper (Anthropic)</td>
        <td>openai ≥1.0,&lt;3.0 · anthropic ≥0.20,&lt;1.0</td>
        <td>⚡ 빠름 (~5개)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">langchain</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[langchain]"</code></td>
        <td>LangChain + LangGraph 통합 (콜백 실시간 추적)</td>
        <td>langchain ≥1.0,&lt;3.0 · langchain-core · langchain-openai · langchain-anthropic · langgraph ≥1.0,&lt;3.0</td>
        <td>🔶 중간 (~30개)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">crewai</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[crewai]"</code></td>
        <td>CrewAI 통합 (역할 기반 멀티에이전트)</td>
        <td>crewai ≥1.0,&lt;2.0</td>
        <td>🔴 무거움 (~100개 전이 의존성)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">autogen</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[autogen]"</code></td>
        <td>AutoGen 통합 (async-first, 0.4+ API)</td>
        <td>pyautogen ≥0.3,&lt;1.0 · autogen-agentchat ≥0.4,&lt;1.0 · autogen-core ≥0.4,&lt;1.0</td>
        <td>🔴 무거움 (단독 격리 권장)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">eval</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[eval]"</code></td>
        <td>DeepEvalAdapter (5종) + RagasAdapter (4종 RAG)</td>
        <td>deepeval ≥0.20,&lt;4.0 · ragas ≥0.4,&lt;2.0 · datasets ≥4.0,&lt;6.0 · langchain ≥0.2</td>
        <td>🔴 무거움</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">serve</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[serve]"</code></td>
        <td>FastAPI 웹 대시보드 (<code>agent-eval serve</code>)</td>
        <td>fastapi ≥0.110,&lt;1.0 · uvicorn[standard] ≥0.29,&lt;1.0 · jinja2 ≥3.1,&lt;4.0 · python-multipart ≥0.0.9,&lt;1.0</td>
        <td>⚡ 빠름 (~8개)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">pdf</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[pdf]"</code></td>
        <td>PDF 파일 파싱 (한국어 RAG 데이터셋 생성)</td>
        <td>pypdf ≥3.0,&lt;7.0 · pdfplumber ≥0.10,&lt;1.0</td>
        <td>⚡ 빠름 (~3개)</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin:0 0 6px">조합 편의 extras</div>
  <table class="mtable">
    <thead><tr><th>Extra</th><th>설치 명령</th><th>포함 내용</th><th>비고</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">all</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[all]"</code></td>
        <td>llm + langchain + eval + serve + pdf <strong>(crewai·autogen 제외)</strong></td>
        <td>✅ 권장 — 합리적 설치 시간</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">frameworks</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[frameworks]"</code></td>
        <td>langchain + crewai + autogen 한 번에 (기존 호환)</td>
        <td>⚠️ crewai(pydantic&lt;2.12) + pyautogen(pydantic≥2.12) silent downgrade 발생 가능</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code class="t">full</code></td>
        <td><code>pip install "agent-evaluator[full]"</code></td>
        <td>all + crewai + autogen 포함 진짜 전체</td>
        <td>⚠️ 설치 10분+ 소요, pydantic 충돌 가능</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
