  <div class="note tip" style="margin-top:12px">💡 <strong>권장 설치 시나리오</strong>: LangChain/LangGraph 사용 → <code>[langchain]</code> · CrewAI만 → <code>[crewai]</code> · AutoGen만 → <code>[autogen]</code> (crewai·autogen 동시 설치 시 pydantic 버전 충돌 가능, <code>[frameworks]</code> 또는 <code>[full]</code> 사용 시 주의)</div>
</section>

<!-- ── 아키텍처 ── -->
<section class="sec" id="architecture">
  <div class="sec-title">🏗️ 아키텍처 개요</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">3개 레이어, 25개 지표. Layer 1+2 (16종)는 외부 API 없이 동작.</div>
  <table class="mtable">
    <thead><tr><th>레이어</th><th>분류</th><th>트래커 수</th><th>의존성</th><th>핵심 지표</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><span class="badge l1">L1</span></td><td>Foundation</td><td>6종</td><td>없음</td><td>TCR, Accuracy, Hallucination, Quality, Latency, Token Cost</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge l2">L2</span></td><td>Agentic</td><td>5종</td><td>없음</td><td>Tool Efficiency, Selection F1, Retry, Coordination, Workflow</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge l2">L2</span></td><td>Security <span class="badge req-b">opt-in</span></td><td>5종</td><td>없음</td><td>Injection, Leakage, AuthZ, PrivEsc, ChainAttack</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge l3">L3</span></td><td>DeepEval</td><td>5종</td><td>deepeval + OpenAI</td><td>G-Eval, Hallucination, Toxicity, Bias, Answer Relevancy</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge l3">L3</span></td><td>Ragas</td><td>4종</td><td>ragas + OpenAI</td><td>faithfulness, answer_relevancy, context_recall, context_precision</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<!-- ── PerformanceMonitor ── -->
<section class="sec" id="performance-monitor">
  <div class="sec-title">🎛️ PerformanceMonitor</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">Layer 1+2 트래커 16종을 내부에서 조율하는 중앙 오케스트레이터. 대부분의 사용 사례에서 이 클래스만으로 충분합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head">
      <span class="cls-name">PerformanceMonitor</span><span class="kind cls">class</span>
      <span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.agent_evaluator</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">생성자 파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">output_dir</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"results/"</code></td><td>JSON/HTML 리포트 저장 디렉토리</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">pricing</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict[str,float]</span></td><td><code>{"input":0.003,"output":0.015}</code></td><td>1K 토큰당 비용 (USD). TokenEconomyTracker에 전달됩니다.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_hallucination_detection</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>HallucinationDetector 활성화 (LLM 호출 비용 발생)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_security_metrics</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>Layer 2 보안 트래커 5종 활성화</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">security_config</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>ToolAuthorizationTracker 설정 (allowed_tools, restricted_tools 등)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_transparency</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>TestTransparencyManager 활성화</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">주요 메서드</div>
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드 시그니처</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">record_task(result, ground_truth=None, context=None, request=None, response=None, expected_elements=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>TaskResult를 모든 활성 트래커에 기록. 선택 파라미터로 정확도·품질 평가 정밀도 향상.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">generate_report()</span></td><td><span class="r">EvaluationReport</span></td><td>수집 데이터를 집계해 EvaluationReport 객체 반환</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">save_to_file(filename)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td><code>{output_dir}/{filename}.json</code> + <code>.html</code> 저장</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">evaluate_with_golden_dataset(agent_fn, dataset_path=None, ...)</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>골든 데이터셋으로 에이전트 자동 평가</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">compare_with_thresholds()</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>업계 임계값과 현재 지표 비교</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">reset()</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>모든 트래커 상태 초기화</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="note tip" style="margin-top:12px">💡 <strong>record_task 팁</strong>: <code>request</code>(질문), <code>ground_truth</code>(정답), <code>expected_elements</code>(체크리스트)를 함께 전달하면 정확도·품질 평가 정밀도가 높아집니다.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TaskResult ── -->
<section class="sec" id="task-result">
  <div class="sec-title">📋 TaskResult</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">단일 태스크 실행 결과를 담는 dataclass. <strong>직접 생성보다 <code>create_taskresult()</code> 사용을 권장합니다</strong> — 점수 필드를 자동 계산합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">TaskResult</span><span class="kind cls">dataclass</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.agent_evaluator</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">필수 필드 (11개)</div>
      {% call field_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>태스크 고유 식별자</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>TaskType.value 문자열 (e.g. <code>"qa"</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">success</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td>태스크 성공 여부</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">completion_score</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>완료도 점수 (0.0–1.0). create_taskresult()가 자동 계산.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">accuracy_score</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>정확도 점수 (0.0–1.0). Token F1+Jaccard+LCS+Char 가중 조합.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">execution_time</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>실행 시간 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">tokens_used</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict[str,int]</span></td><td><code>{"input": N, "output": N, "total": N}</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">tool_calls</span></td><td><span class="t">List[Dict]</span></td><td><code>[{"tool": "name", "input": {...}, "output": "..."}]</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">attempts</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td>시도 횟수 (1 = 재시도 없음)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">errors</span></td><td><span class="t">List[str]</span></td><td>오류 메시지 목록. 없으면 <code>[]</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">timestamp</span></td><td><span class="t">datetime</span></td><td>기록 시각</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">선택 필드 (7개)</div>
      {% call field_table(col3='용도') %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">expected_tools</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[str]]</span></td><td>기대 도구 목록 — ToolSelectionTracker F1 계산</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">agent_interactions</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>멀티에이전트 상호작용 (CrewAI)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">chain_steps</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>체인 실행 단계 (LangChain)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">graph_traversal</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[Dict]</span></td><td>그래프 순회 경로 (LangGraph)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">conversation_turns</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>대화 턴 기록 (AutoGen)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">state_transitions</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>상태 전이 이력 (LangGraph)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">framework</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>프레임워크 식별자 (<code>"crewai"</code>, <code>"langchain"</code> 등)</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TaskType ── -->
<section class="sec" id="task-type">
  <div class="sec-title">🏷️ TaskType</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">태스크 유형 Enum. 유형별로 정확도 계산 전략이 달라집니다. <code>create_taskresult()</code>에서는 소문자 문자열로도 전달 가능합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">TaskType</span><span class="kind en">enum</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.agent_evaluator</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>Enum 값</th><th>문자열</th><th>정확도 전략</th><th>용도</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.QA</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>Token F1(40%) + Jaccard(30%) + LCS(20%) + Char(10%)</td><td>질의응답, 사실 확인</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.CODE_GENERATION</span></td><td><code>"code_generation"</code></td><td>AST 비교 → 정규화 비교</td><td>코드 생성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.DATA_ANALYSIS</span></td><td><code>"data_analysis"</code></td><td>수치 추출 + 텍스트 유사도</td><td>데이터 분석</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.DOCUMENT_CREATION</span></td><td><code>"document_creation"</code></td><td>텍스트 유사도 + 구조 검사</td><td>문서·보고서 작성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.INFORMATION_RETRIEVAL</span></td><td><code>"information_retrieval"</code></td><td>Token F1 + Jaccard</td><td>정보 검색, RAG</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.REASONING</span></td><td><code>"reasoning"</code></td><td>단계 정합성 + 결론 매칭</td><td>추론, 논리 문제</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.CREATIVE</span></td><td><code>"creative"</code></td><td>다양성 지표 (유사도 역산)</td><td>창작, 글쓰기</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.CODING</span></td><td><code>"coding"</code></td><td>AST 비교 → 정규화 비교</td><td>코딩 태스크</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.PLANNING</span></td><td><code>"planning"</code></td><td>단계 커버리지 + 순서 매칭</td><td>계획 수립</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">TaskType.TOOL_USE</span></td><td><code>"tool_use"</code></td><td>도구 선택 F1 + 결과 품질</td><td>도구 호출</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── create_taskresult ── -->
<section class="sec" id="helpers">
  <div class="sec-title">🔧 create_taskresult()</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">Agent 실행 결과에서 TaskResult를 생성하는 권장 방법. completion_score, accuracy_score, tokens_used, tool_calls, timestamp를 자동 계산합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">create_taskresult</span><span class="kind fn">function</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.helpers.taskresult_helpers</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>태스크 고유 식별자</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">question</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>에이전트에 전달한 질문/입력</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">response</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>에이전트 응답 텍스트</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">ground_truth</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>정답/기대 출력 — accuracy_score 계산 기준</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">execution_time</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>—</td><td>실행 시간 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>TaskType 소문자 문자열</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">openai_response</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Any</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>OpenAI 응답 객체 — 토큰/도구 자동 추출</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">langchain_result</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Any</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>LangChain 결과 dict — 토큰/도구 자동 추출</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">has_error</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>에러 발생 시 completion_score = 0</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">error_message</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>에러 메시지</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
<pre style="margin-top:12px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> create_taskresult

task = <span class="fn">create_taskresult</span>(
    task_id=<span class="st">"qa_001"</span>, question=<span class="st">"수도는?"</span>,
    response=<span class="st">"서울입니다."</span>, ground_truth=<span class="st">"서울"</span>,
    execution_time=<span class="nm">1.23</span>, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>,
)
<span class="cm"># OpenAI 응답 자동 추출</span>
task = <span class="fn">create_taskresult</span>(task_id=<span class="st">"qa_002"</span>, question=q, response=resp.choices[<span class="nm">0</span>].message.content,
    ground_truth=expected, execution_time=elapsed, openai_response=resp)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── evaluation_session ── -->
<section class="sec" id="context-mgr">
